WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.440
Pri-Para-Ding-Dong!

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.150
We have an announcement for you all.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:10.570
Next week, the third Divine Idol Grand Prix,

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.800
the competition for the Divine Shoes, will take place!

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:24.000
The Divine Idol Grand Prix...

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.390
Capisce!

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.080
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.210
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.410
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.980
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.010
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:18.960
All right! The next round of the Grand Prix is next week!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.100
Thinking back now...

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:26.200
last time Garumageddon swooped in and won before we could even comprete-pri.

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:32.930
This time, SoLaMi SMILE's gonna triumph-pri!

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:34.580
That's too bad!

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.180
Y'see, we're already planning to win.

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:37.730
Pri!

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:42.340
We can't rock the centre stage if we <i>tie</i> for the win like last time.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.820
Demonstration of superiority!

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:46.760
This match shall be Dressing Pafé's uncontested victory!

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:50.510
In your dreams! It's going to be SoLaMi SMILE's uncontested victory-pri!

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:51.880
Uncontested victory!

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.650
Let's both do our best.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:54.730
Yeah!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:01.940
...the third Divine Idol Grand Prix, the competition for the Divine Shoes, will take place!

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:06.040
Ooh, so next week is the Divine Idol Grand Prix...

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.760
Maho-chan...

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:12.600
Oh, but there's no need to worry, Hibiki-san.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:16.170
We can form our team at our own pace.

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:23.850
And as you're all aware, the team who wins the Divine Idol Grand Prix

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:30.330
will not only gain entry to the main competition, but also free one piece of the Divine Coord.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:33.890
And in commemoration,

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:35.850
that team's name will be insribed on the plate.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:40.180
The Divine Coord, yearned after by girls the world over.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.410
The piece which will be freed this time is the Divine Shoes!

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:47.910
Mm, I just can't wait for next week's Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.820
Lala-san!

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:00.910
I had so much fun back then.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:04.300
I'd been so nervous and hesitant about going into PriPara,

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:07.220
but she was friendly to me and showed me around.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.880
Divine Idols...

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:13.920
I want to be one too!

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.190
Oh, but...

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:22.030
When I went back to PriPara,
I couldn't believe what happened...

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:25.340
I can't ever go back again!

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.620
Y–Yes...

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:35.520
N–No, I don't want to!

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.930
I swore I'd never go back to PriPara again.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.820
Okay...

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:47.080
I promise I'll go to PriPara after my
flower arrangement lesson tomorrow.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.930
I just have to go in, right?

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:09.330
My word!

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:14.890
The juxtaposition of the proud Chinese silver grass
and the dainty cosmos flower...

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.880
Chiri-san, how did you envision this?

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:20.580
Well, Father,

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:23.890
I wanted to bring out the convolution within my own heart.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:26.810
Nothing less from my daughter!

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:30.430
Flowers are living beings; so, too, are humans.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:34.760
To express the desires of the heart is paramount!

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:40.570
You're truly worthy to succeed the 7th
generation of the Tsukikawa household.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:42.190
How admirable!

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:46.640
Th–Thank you very much.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.160
Bug... bug... bug...

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.120
What's the matter?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:58.960
Th–There was a creepy crawly on a flower and now it's on my sleeve!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.090
Please, someone take it off!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.960
It has been removed.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:12.110
All this fuss over one insect.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.530
I see you do still lack discipline.

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:22.300
Non, the Divine Idol Grand Prix is right in front of us-ucha...

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:23.780
I know that.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:28.160
That's why I'm scoping out these girls for potential teammates.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:30.500
What about that girl-ucha?

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.200
She won't work. Our heights won't match at all.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:35.910
Okay, then how about her-ucha?

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:36.930
Good morning!

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:37.710
Thanks for waiting!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.840
It's a shame, but she already seems to have a team.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.100
Ucha...

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:46.340
Oh, man, isn't there a good teammate for me somewhere?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.450
Hi there! If anyone's looking for
a teammate, Ponkan's availa-Braque!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.920
No need to be de-mural-Da Vinci!

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:58.380
Ajimi-sensei seems to want a partner... and she's looking this way-ucha.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:59.970
Stare-stare-stencil...

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:01.750
Wh–What should we do?

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.730
She's coming on so strong it's kind of offputting-ucha...

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:08.190
If we joined a team, I feel she'd throw me into the background.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:12.990
What a pretty butterfly-Da Vinci.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.940
Is what you might think...

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:16.990
But don't be triptych up!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.710
It's actually a Gentileschi moth!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.420
Doesn't it drive you c-Reiko, age 5?

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.130
Come back, little moth. I haven't Magritte-d you yet.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:28.380
Looks like we're safe-ucha.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:32.400
But we do still need another two members...

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:37.160
What if we had Ajimi-sensei join us and borrowed Cosmo-san as well-ucha?

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.800
That won't work either!

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:42.300
The team's average age will shoot up!

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:45.450
Wow, you really went and said it-ucha.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.850
Have a good day, milady.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:06.400
I don't want... to go to PriPara...

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.940
I knew it. I can't do it. I'm going home.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:15.130
Hey, isn't that...

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:19.960
Manaka-senpai!

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.850
It's Chiri-chan! I can't believe it!

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:28.290
So you must be SoLaMi SMILE...
and the members of Dressing Pafé as well?

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.550
Chiri-chan?

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.890
I've heard that name somewhere before...

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:42.660
That's right – it was half a year ago.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:52.260
So you're that girl who came to PriPara for the first time.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:54.820
Yes...

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:56.660
My name is Tsukikawa Chiri.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:02.190
You said you were a grade five student at Pakuchi
Primary School the next town over, right, Chiri-chan?

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:08.020
What, Packuchi Primary School? Ain't that the rich kids' school from over in Pirogane?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:13.150
Yeah, and isn't it a combined school for kindergarten through to university?

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.900
Tsukikawa... that's an uncommon family name.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:20.680
You don't mean from the esteemed
Tsukikawa school of flower arrangement?

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.220
Y–Yes...

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.550
A bolt from the blue!

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:23.660
That's so amazing!
A bolt from the blue!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.320
That's so amazing!

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:28.160
Oh – oh, no, it's nothing amazing...

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:32.670
Um... I mean... anyway, I have to go home soon.

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:35.130
What? You're going home already?

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.540
But you just arrived...

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:41.140
Chiri-chan, you came back to PriPara after we met, right?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.850
Y–Yes, I did... once...

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:47.960
But PriPara doesn't suit me,

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.440
like my body doesn't agree with it...

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.970
There's nothing to worry about. In PriPara, we're all idols!

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:57.300
You've gotta let it all hang out! Be yourself!

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.220
Be bold and brilliant!

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.910
And with an unwavering heart.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.980
Oh, but...

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.050
No, stop! Please sto-op!

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:07.080
Got you.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:07.240
No, stop! Please sto-op!

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:08.790
Come on, you'll be fine.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.250
No!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:29.310
What?

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.040
Non, over there-ucha!

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.130
Yeah!

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:34.590
What a perfect idol aura!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:38.070
Um... You're Chiri-chan... right?

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:40.760
Lower your head!

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:44.290
You there, prostrate yourselves and capisce!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.000
Capisce!

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.750
Ah, I automatically capisce-d!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.540
Boo-hoo-hoo...

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:04.300
What the heck was that?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.260
She totally made me capisce against my will!

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:09.490
Well, you did say to let it all hang out and be yourself...

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:10.640
More importantly...

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:13.710
She's not acting anything like how she did before-pri.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.410
Be silent!

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.620
I suppose I can explain to you.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:24.800
<i>I'll do my best to become a lovely idol like you!</i>

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:25.910
<i>It's my dream!</i>

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:27.870
<i>Capisce!</i>

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.540
When my past self met Manaka Lala,

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:35.340
she turned me into a bland copy of her – an insipid <i>lovely</i> idol.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.570
<i>That's right – capisce!</i>

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:39.800
<i>See you later!</i>

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.780
<i>Goodbye!</i>

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.050
<i>Hi, everyone!</i>

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:47.000
<i>Starting now, our Parajuku area's PriPara system</i>

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.850
<i>has entered the Divine Idol Grand Prix mode!</i>

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.320
<i>Commence the update process!</i>

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:59.490
That day, a Celeb Jewel was
bestowed upon me from Heaven,

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.690
and I was transformed.

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:06.760
The true gleam of the diamond resting in my heart

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:10.830
was brought to brilliance by the power of the Celeb jewel.

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:15.710
So you changed after you got that jewel...

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.740
That's an un-pri-evable change.

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:21.620
B–But I think the celebrity air suits you. It's cool!

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:22.130
Hmph.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:25.780
That's right! You do have a discerning eye, don't you?

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.020
As a matter of fact, Miss Chiri's coord

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:32.190
is from a traditional and
well-established brand, Dear Crown!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:37.230
It's said only true celebrities are permitted to wear this brand!

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:40.060
Wow, that's so amazing!

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.020
Chiri-chan?

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:45.570
Could you refrain from touching me?

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.930
Lala of SoLaMi SMILE.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:53.870
I shall not entertain your overtures of amiability.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:54.750
Whuh?

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.330
Such behaviour is unbefitting for my rival.

00:12:58.330 --> 00:12:59.090
Whuh?

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.500
Victor of innumerable Grands Prix

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:06.770
and established centre of the ever-popular SoLaMi SMILE:

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:07.980
Manaka Lala!

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:09.010
P–Present!

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:14.020
How dare you make my esteemed self aspire to you!

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:15.980
What?

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.900
I shall not countenance this!

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:20.170
It is an abasement!

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:21.540
Capisce!

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:24.190
Argh, she made us all capisce again!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.160
Wait just a minute!

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:32.590
<i>I'm</i> Onee-chan – I mean, Lala's rival!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:35.630
You're not allowed to swoop in and steal my rival!

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:38.210
And who are you supposed to be?

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:39.840
Ahem!

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:44.130
Are you familiar with the hottest idol group around, Triangle?

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.380
Triangle...

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:49.550
Ah, now I recall.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.470
It was the strangest thing! At that
most sacred Divine Idol Grand Prix,

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.810
some juvenile charlatan <i>did</i> give a sham performance.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.560
<i>That</i> Triangle, I presume?

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.910
What are you calling a "sham performance"-ucha?

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.710
Hey, what do you think you're
doing to my beloved little sister?

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:07.030
That's right! How dare you touch my imaginary little sister!

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.050
Lower your heads!

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:11.240
All of you, prostrate yourselves and capisce!

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:14.510
Aye!

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:18.250
I don't <i>wanna</i> capisce!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.210
But she's so darn intimidating!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.620
Wait a minute. Just who do you think you are?

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:26.720
You're super rude! I want to hear your name!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.470
I do not give my name to such uncivil girls.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.830
She ticks me off!

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:31.220
Um, so, Non, this girl's in grade five and her name's Chiri.
She ticks me off!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:35.500
Um, so, Non, this girl's in grade five and her name's Chiri.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:40.520
We got became friends when she first came to PriPara half a year ago.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.130
You became friends?

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.190
With this condescending girl?

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:45.440
There's no way!

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:49.460
<i>It really is unbelievable-ucha.</i>

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.840
<i>Even though she's only a year older than Non,</i>

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:56.910
<i>she has even that self-centred, swaggering Dorothy...</i>

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:59.900
<i>bowing and scraping in the face of her aura-ucha.</i>

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:03.380
<i>Is she concealing something?</i>

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.090
<i>Even so...</i>

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:09.870
You can look forward to me claiming the next Grand Prix.

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:12.050
And I won't need any sham performance, either.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:14.760
She <i>really</i> ticks me off!

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:18.410
I am a Japanese maiden trained in the traditional arts;

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:21.400
upon beholding my pure and elegant performance,

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.480
not a member of the audience will remain seated:

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:28.940
every one of them will be spurred to a standing ovation!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:32.910
Is that so? Well, if you're <i>so</i> confident,

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.070
then we can compete right now!

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:36.910
Bring it on-ucha!

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.910
Of course I accept.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.570
You should probably pri-think that, Chiri-chan.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:45.820
I will permit only those who do not know defeat to caution me.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:46.750
Pri!

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:51.100
We'll perform and whoever gets the most likes wins!

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:51.900
Ucha!

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:53.060
Very well.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.510
Here we go, Jululu-chan.

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:02.770
Today you and <i>Lala's</i> mama – that's Mama's mama –

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.230
are going to practice eating with a spoon!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.210
Ran! Ran-ny!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.370
N–No, not Granny.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.000
I'm your mama's mama.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.450
Ran-ny! Ran!

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:24.400
Wow, Jululu, well done!

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:41.350
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:43.850
Starting the Coord Change.

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:49.380
Incorporating flower motifs, and
rosette elements and frills aplenty,

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:50.840
like a fairy's dress!

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:53.470
Triangle Lovely Coord!

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:54.490
Kano-pero!

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.280
Beep-b-ucha.

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:05.710
Hi, everyone!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.330
It's been a while!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.430
Triangle!

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:09.810
Where've you been?

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:11.360
We missed you!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.940
Let us ascertain her skills.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.490
Our concert today...

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.480
shall usher in a new Ice Age.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.940
So superior cool!

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:29.900
Pippi-pappi-pu!

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:31.730
Kano-pero!

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:34.040
Pero-pero!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:48.590
Ju!
Kano-pero!

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:49.170
Pipi!
Kano-pero!

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:49.240
Kano-pero!

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:52.910
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:56.350
Zoom!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:03.780
Hm? Ehe! Swoosh!

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:06.260
Let's go! Yeah!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:07.730
Everyone together!

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.440
Everyone join hands!

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:14.880
Secret wonderful scope!

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:19.500
Super Cyalume Change!

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:25.380
Kano-pero!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:25.760
Ju!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:26.410
Pipi!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.120
Triangle's the best!

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.810
Man, I really do love Triangle!

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.830
Seeing them perform again got my heart pounding!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:57.570
I don't care if you <i>are</i> holograms; keep on performing!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:01.470
Thank you-pipi!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:04.010
All right! That's it!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.280
Kano-pero!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.920
I see she's not <i>entirely</i> without skill.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.180
However...

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.730
She doesn't hold a candle...

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.150
Isn't some Chiri-chan girl up next?

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.860
Say... say what?

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:22.940
Now then.

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:27.780
Why don't we have a look at what little miss effortless victory can do?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:29.170
Huh?

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.270
She sure is late.

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:33.460
She's not showing up.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.250
Yeah...

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:34.980
What?

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.030
Ucha?

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:40.060
Why can't I perform?

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:43.230
I'm supposed to duel that Non girl.

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:45.050
What?

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.290
I must form a team first?

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:49.710
That is true.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:55.050
A celebrity such as myself should début after careful consideration and in full splendor.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:57.140
It's unavoidable, I suppose.

00:20:57.140 --> 00:20:59.140
Cha!
Come back here, Chiri!

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:00.170
Are you running away?

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:00.820
Chiri-chan, are you not débuting today after all?

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.530
What's with the not performing?

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:03.540
It's such a shame.

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:05.100
Chiri!
It's such a shame.

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:05.120
It's such a shame.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.990
Lower your heads!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.490
Capisce!

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:14.830
She made us do it again!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.210
She's ruthless!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.720
I'm sick of this!

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:30.380
Why do I start acting like that when I go into PriPara?

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:35.770
I'm never going back to PriPara ever again!

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:39.270
No!

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:48.560
Musicianship.

00:21:50.090 --> 00:21:51.070
A fishing ship.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:52.460
FRIENDSHIP

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:53.870
Frie–
FRIENDSHIP

00:21:56.560 --> 00:21:57.860
Yes, that's right!

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:01.970
Hibiki-san, the Divine Idol Grand Prix is next week,

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:05.050
but don't worry about that. Just keep doing your best.

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:06.730
Na. Na!

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:13.210
Not happening.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:15.520
No way...

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:18.740
Fuwari, let's leave it at that for today, okay?

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:56.120
The Divine Idol Grand Prix has started-tori!

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:58.050
We haven't completed the team formation ceremony,

00:23:58.050 --> 00:24:00.180
so there's no way we can make it-tori!

00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:01.040
That's fine.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:05.610
I know Fuwari, Maho-chan and I will be a real team one day.

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:07.320
Is that really okay with you?

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:08.120
Eh?

00:24:08.120 --> 00:24:12.140
I'm not going to give up.
I'm going to keep trying until the very end!

00:24:12.140 --> 00:24:13.430
Fuwari!

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:16.620
Next time, <i>Hurry Up! Divine Idol Grand Prix!</i>

00:24:16.620 --> 00:24:19.850
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
